        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape Game Room Collection Volume 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This contains a collection of multiple escape games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layout and controls have been optimized for PC, and the game has been reconstructed for a comfortable gameplay experience in a high-resolution environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a total of 6 escape games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Simple and accessible classic escape-game style<br>😌 A calm and relaxing atmosphere<br>🎨 High-resolution visuals rebuilt for PC<br>🔍 A balanced difficulty that’s not too hard<br>🔀 Multiple endings<br>🖱️ Optimized for mouse controls<br>💾 Auto-save &amp; manual-save support<br>🌐 Supports 15 languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Titles (6 Games)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Escape Game: Security<br>・Escape Game: Seaside House 2<br>・Escape Game: Vacation Villa<br>・Escape Game: Rooftop Escape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Escape Game: Christmas 3 <br>・Escape Game: Resort Room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Approx. 20-40 minutes per game (depends on player's exploration speed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total playtime is around 2-4 hours.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape Game Room Collection Volume 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This contains a collection of multiple escape games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layout and controls have been optimized for PC, and the game has been reconstructed for a comfortable gameplay experience in a high-resolution environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a total of 6 escape games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Simple and accessible classic escape-game style<br>😌 A calm and relaxing atmosphere<br>🎨 High-resolution visuals rebuilt for PC<br>🔍 A balanced difficulty that’s not too hard<br>🔀 Multiple endings<br>🖱️ Optimized for mouse controls<br>💾 Auto-save &amp; manual-save support<br>🌐 Supports 15 languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Titles (6 Games)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Escape Game: Security<br>・Escape Game: Seaside House 2<br>・Escape Game: Vacation Villa<br>・Escape Game: Rooftop Escape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Escape Game: Christmas 3 <br>・Escape Game: Resort Room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Approx. 20-40 minutes per game (depends on player's exploration speed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total playtime is around 2-4 hours.</p>",
